# Internationalization (i18n)

- Every new user-visible string needs keys in **both**:
  - `client/locales/en/translation.json`
  - `client/locales/es/translation.json`
- Use `useTranslation()` + `t('key')` — **never** hardcode UI copy in components
- Prefer nested keys by feature (`team.*`, `cases.*`, `calendar.*`)
- When renaming/removing UI text, clean up both locale files
